      "spam": false,
      "value": "While this would be also a nice feature, I have a work around for now.  I have my own custom sit animation that lowers where I sit to better match the common chair, HOWEVER... it would not be universal, and if chairs have varying heights, it would not work too well.  \n\nThat being said, I would like to see this feature, as someone who is often with large avatars, I would like a better function.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
