      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{59715a9e4979f85df8d62ef5|full_name}: I have experimented a bit with this and there are a few more issues. Like how long your avatar's legs are. Basically, without custom animations, a lot of extreme cases break, so until we can find a generic solution that works for everything, you'll need to provide a custom animation if your avatar diverges from \"standard\". Also, there is the issue that the Chair itself can provide an animation, like if its a chaise-lounge, so the measure points and placement of the avatar need to be completely different.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5a05fc8df30983107bd583aa",
      "author": {
        "_id": "58d60ee5acff4444923bdef0",
        "alias": "Slim Dingo",
        "aliasID": "65ba0134ed6eefce4ceb080b",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/3b6505b7e799ce1acff4a18890dd3f93.png",
        "created": "2017-03-25T06:32:05.243Z",
        "name": "hackspanner",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2017-11-10T19:22:53.261Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
