      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "59f87b10391e302671a84488",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "But if your avatar is too small, your legs will penetrate into the front of the chair (if we place the hip bone at the center of the chair). So the distance from hip to knee must also be measured. Also, avatar's place the \"pelvis\" bone at very different parts in the rig. This is an extremely complex thing to deal with, and has no simple solution that will look good for everyone.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
