      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{58d60ee5acff4444923bdef0|full_name}: I would hope that linking to the hip bone would alleviate the issues, though yes if your legs are longer they would sink through the ground, but honestly... I would rather have that, then floating off the chair.  it would help keep animations more universal per avatar.  If the chair does its own custom animation, as it is now, you will have that floating, but if based on the hips, there shouldn't be much issue, and having a custom animation on the avatar itself can have the legs up, but if custom on chair, eh... might have some feet sinking, but again... it'd be the lesser of two evils.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
